SUMMARY:The Afterlife of Trees (Davidson)
DESCRIPTION:Dead trees are full of life! Join us at Fisher Farm for an in-person workshop on the critical role standing dead trees or “snags” play in providing vital wildlife habitat and supporting forest biodiversity. Learn how snags support wildlife as well as how to create them on your own property. Participants will get hands-on experience selecting ideal snag trees and various methods for creating them. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/the-afterlife-of-trees-davidson/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
