SUMMARY:Antioch Bay Workday (Red Springs)
DESCRIPTION:Join TNC to explore this unique landscape and remove encroaching loblolly and sweetgum saplings using loppers\, pruners\, and hand-removal. Stewardship in the Carolina Bays has an impact on survival and breeding success for amphibians that depend on them over winter.  \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/antioch-bay-workday-red-springs-2/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-294.png
END:VEVENT
