CREATED:20260827T150737Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260827T150737Z
UID:10001765-1792695600-1792701000@ncwf.org
SUMMARY:Beyond the Basics: Deer Hunting Start Smart: Gear\, Expectations & Tools That Work (Online)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Fall Line Outdoors Chapter for a deer hunting webinar series! Build your core hunting skills and learn what it takes to start deer hunting. In this webinar we’ll cover licensure and NCWRC apprentice pathways\, hunting ethics\, every hunter’s conservation role\, time and cost commitments. We’ll also discuss choosing and fitting a weapon\, basic firearm care\, and a practical pack dump with essential gear. Then we’ll introduce advanced tools like rangefinders\, wind apps\, shooting sticks\, deer carts\, calls\, scents\, and decoys. You’ll leave with the skills and knowledge to begin your hunting journey with confidence. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/deer-hunting-tools/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/tools.jpg
END:VEVENT
