SUMMARY:Spooky Trivia (Greensboro)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Triad Wild! Chapter and test your spooky (and not so spooky) plant\, animal\, and general knowledge while supporting a great cause\, connect with like-minded people\, and learn how you can get involved with wildlife conservation\, education\, and habitat restoration in the greater Greensboro-area. \nTeams will compete for prizes – plus we will be holding raffles throughout the evening. One of the questions will come directly from our October newsletter\, so make sure you are getting our newsletter to be the first to know. See you there! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/spooky-trivia-greensboro/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/octtrivia.jpg
END:VEVENT
