SUMMARY:Leaf Peeping on the Cane Creek Mountains - Bird's Eye View (Snow Camp)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Triad Wild and Tri-County Conservationists Chapters for a joint nature walk at Cane Creek Mountain! This afternoon hike will coincide with peak fall colors. The focus for this 2.5 mile hike is on getting to the tower at the summit and ascending through the autumn canopy to get a panoramic view of fall colors\, plus a view of downtown Greensboro in the distance! Fall bird migration will still be ongoing but winding down\, so we will possibly see migratory birds along the way.  \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/leaf-peeping/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/canecreek.jpg
END:VEVENT
