DTSTAMP:20261013T151424Z
CREATED:20261013T151423Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261013T151424Z
UID:10001830-1793116800-1793124000@ncwf.org
SUMMARY:Lake Tomahawk Nest Box Building Workday (Black Mountain)
DESCRIPTION:Lake Tomahawk in Black Mountain is a hotspot for wildlife with multiple species breeding and nesting along the edge of the lake. Join NCWF Swannanoa Valley Wild at Lake Tomahawk in Black Mountain for a nest box building workday and bird walk. We’ll be primarily constructing blue bird houses to be installed around the lake later this fall. This is a fun family-friendly opportunity to support wildlife conservation on a grassroots level. We’ll meet under the shelter beside the tennis courts. See you there! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/lake-tomahawk-nest-box-building-workday-black-mountain/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/ltnestbox.jpg
END:VEVENT
