DTSTAMP:20261013T140510Z
CREATED:20261013T140509Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261013T140510Z
UID:10001825-1793268000-1793275200@ncwf.org
SUMMARY:Native Shrub Planting (Charlotte)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Charlotte Wildlife Stewards Chapter and TreesCharlotte to enhance and restore wildlife habitat at the recently renovated LC Coleman Park in the historic Washington Heights neighborhood. \nWe will work alongside TreesCharlotte volunteers to plant hundreds of native shrubs and trees along a tributary of Stewart Creek\, creating a riparian buffer that enhances wildlife habitat\, reduces erosion\, and filters stormwater before it reaches the creek. \nREGISTER HERE
